# Architecture Overview
- Stack: Node.js, Express, ES6 / CommonJS modules matching project imports.
- Layering: Strictly enforce Route -> Controller -> Service -> Model separation.
- Do NOT place database calls or business logic inside route files or controllers.
- Use explicit error classes inheriting from `AppError` (e.g., `NotFoundError`).
- Never introduce new external libraries without checking `package.json` first.